            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "PegCullen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe had interesting ingredients and a fabulous flavor! I did add one extra can of beans based on other reviews but the olives, to me, made this great! We will definitely make it again...maybe during bowl season!",
            "datePublished": "2016-11-11T23:20:16.063Z"
